{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP CARDS is a card game based on playing cards, where you can enjoy endless fun and thrilling excitement through the process of continuous upgrading and advancement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting started with the game is simple; I believe anyone can easily master it. But to reach higher levels, you need to proceed steadily, making experienced decisions and brainstorming-like thinking with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combination of multiple different card types, more basic game play upgrades;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple card effects appear randomly, adding more opportunities and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple special effects enhance unlocking, allowing players to climb higher levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple upgrade reward options to create your unique gaming style;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still under continuous improvement and updates. If you have any good ideas or suggestions, feel free to contact me.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907110?t=1760410426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907110?t=1760410426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907110/7ffa7dcfb4923c39c070ea170c123f11f12d3c0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760410426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907110/7ffa7dcfb4923c39c070ea170c123f11f12d3c0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760410426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3933740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP CARDS is a card game based on playing cards, where you can enjoy endless fun and thrilling excitement through the process of continuous upgrading and advancement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting started with the game is simple; I believe anyone can easily master it. But to reach higher levels, you need to proceed steadily, making experienced decisions and brainstorming-like thinking with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combination of multiple different card types, more basic game play upgrades;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple card effects appear randomly, adding more opportunities and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple special effects enhance unlocking, allowing players to climb higher levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple upgrade reward options to create your unique gaming style;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still under continuous improvement and updates. If you have any good ideas or suggestions, feel free to contact me.</p>","developers":["Zeorge Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907110/45b78a3787b83331f1f57e935850d6649f6cfd83/header.jpg?t=1760410426","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All in-game materials are produced by the working group, and infringement such as unpacking is prohibited.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3907110/945140249/9a7582f7cd1c999b33b78d070437842e23009997/1758635034/